From b4f7140d4d35f91f5e5cd5b4e5a88143758694d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ronghua Zeng <ronghuaz@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sun, 17 May 2026 01:17:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] zephyr: net: wifi: hostap: add WPA2/WPA3-Enterprise
 (802.1X/EAP) support

Add changes across the Zephyr networking stack, hostap integration layer,
and Wi-Fi shell to enable WPA2/WPA3-Enterprise authentication on QCC730.

Change-Id: I4b37c6529f35f3b1074be4a428b47706cfbcb1cf
